{"abstract":[{"text":"Process server-sent events and JSON values that arrive in fragments, such as the output of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"large language models.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON"],["doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON","doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/StreamingJSON"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/StreamingFromAPIs"},"kind":"article","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"DynamicJSON"}],"role":"collectionGroup","roleHeading":"API Collection","title":"Streaming JSON from Web APIs and LLMs"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Streaming web APIs, in particular those of large language models, deliver JSON in two layers:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The response body is a stream of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"server-sent events","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"code":"text/event-stream","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). Each event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carries a small JSON object, a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"delta","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The deltas of a streamed answer often contain ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"fragments of one larger JSON value","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"example the arguments of a tool call or a structured output. No single fragment is valid","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"JSON, but applications want to use the partial result as soon as it becomes available.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"DynamicJSON","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" supports both layers, which can be combined.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Server-sent-events","level":3,"text":"Server-sent events","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/StreamFormat/serverSentEvents","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to read the JSON data of events. Comments, events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without data and the fields ","type":"text"},{"code":"event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"retry","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are skipped. If the data of an event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"equals ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/StreamOptions/terminator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" (by default ","type":"text"},{"code":"[DONE]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), the stream ends.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let (bytes, _) = try await URLSession.shared.bytes(for: request)","for try await delta in JSON.values(from: bytes, format: .serverSentEvents) {","  print(delta.choices?[0]?.delta?.content?.stringValue ?? \"\")","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the names of events matter, which is the case for APIs that distinguish event types by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" field, use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/events(from:)-9gody","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" to get ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/ServerSentEvent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" values:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["for try await event in JSON.events(from: bytes) {","  if event.event == \"content_block_delta\" {","    print(try event.json())","  }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Partial-JSON-values","level":3,"text":"Partial JSON values","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONPartialParser","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" reads a single JSON value that arrives in fragments and returns the best","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"available approximation of the value at any time:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["var parser = JSONPartialParser()","try parser.append(#\"{\"city\": \"Par\"#)","try parser.snapshot()                      // {\"city\": \"Par\"}","try parser.append(#\"is\", \"population\": 21\"#)","try parser.snapshot()                      // {\"city\": \"Paris\"}","try parser.append(\"00000}\")","try parser.finish()                        // {\"city\": \"Paris\", \"population\": 2100000}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A snapshot closes open strings, arrays, and objects. It leaves out object members whose key or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value is incomplete (except for strings, which are shown in their partial form) and numbers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which might still get more digits. As a consequence, every snapshot is a prefix of all later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"snapshots: objects only gain members, arrays only gain elements, and strings only get longer.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The parser validates its input as it arrives and throws a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/StreamError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" as soon as it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cannot be extended to valid JSON.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The asynchronous variant ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/partialValues(from:)-2rdtf","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" takes a sequence of fragments (strings,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data, or bytes) and returns a sequence of ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/PartialJSON","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" snapshots. The last snapshot is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"complete value. ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/PartialJSON/patch(from:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" computes a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONPatch","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" between two successive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"snapshots, which allows clients to apply only the changes to a data model or user interface.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Output-that-is-not-pure-JSON","level":3,"text":"Output that is not pure JSON","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Models often surround JSON with prose and Markdown, or produce JSON with small errors.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/ExtractingJSON","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" describes how to find and parse such JSON leniently.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Putting-it-together","level":3,"text":"Putting it together","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/fragments(from:at:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" extracts the text fragments from the deltas using a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONPointer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". The example below reads the streamed arguments of a tool call using an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenAI-style API; the same code works for Anthropic-style APIs with pointer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"/delta/partial_json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let events = JSON.values(from: bytes, format: .serverSentEvents)","let pointer = try JSONPointer(\"/choices/0/delta/tool_calls/0/function/arguments\")","let fragments = JSON.fragments(from: events, at: pointer)","for try await partial in JSON.partialValues(from: fragments) {","  print(partial.value, partial.isComplete ? \"(complete)\" : \"\")","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The library does not contain provider-specific code. Event layouts differ between providers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and change over time; selecting the fragments with a JSON pointer keeps the code independent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON":{"abstract":[{"text":"Represent, query, mutate, merge, and validate generic JSON values.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"DynamicJSON","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/ExtractingJSON":{"abstract":[{"text":"Find JSON values in text produced by large language models, and parse JSON that is not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"quite valid.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/ExtractingJSON","kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","title":"Extracting JSON from LLM Output","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/extractingjson"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/StreamError":{"abstract":[{"text":"Errors found while reading a stream of JSON values. Each case carries the offset (in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bytes from the beginning of the stream) at which the problem was detected.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StreamError"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/StreamError","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"StreamError"}],"role":"symbol","title":"JSON.StreamError","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/json/streamerror"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/StreamFormat/serverSentEvents":{"abstract":[{"text":"Server-sent events (","type":"text"},{"code":"text/event-stream","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") as used by most streaming web APIs, including","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"those of large language models. The data of each event (the ","type":"text"},{"code":"data","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" fields, joined with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"line feeds) is expected to be a JSON value; events without data, comments, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the fields ","type":"text"},{"code":"event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"retry","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are ignored (use ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSON.events(from:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to access","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them). If the data of an event equals ","type":"text"},{"code":"StreamOptions.terminator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the stream ends.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"After an event with malformed data, reading resumes with the next event.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"serverSentEvents"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/StreamFormat/serverSentEvents","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"JSON.StreamFormat.serverSentEvents","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/json/streamformat/serversentevents"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/StreamOptions/terminator":{"abstract":[{"text":"For format ","type":"text"},{"code":"StreamFormat.serverSentEvents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": if the data of an event equals this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"string, the stream ends without error. The default is ","type":"text"},{"code":"[DONE]","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", as used by the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenAI API and compatible APIs.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"terminator"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/StreamOptions/terminator","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"terminator","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/json/streamoptions/terminator"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/events(from:)-4a8d3":{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns all server-sent events found in ","type":"text"},{"code":"bytes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (e.g. a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Data","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" object).","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"events"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON0B0O6events4fromSayAA15ServerSentEventVGx_tSTRzs5UInt8V7ElementRtzlFZ1SL_xmfp","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON15ServerSentEventV","text":"ServerSentEvent"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/events(from:)-4a8d3","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"events(from:)","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/json/events(from:)-4a8d3"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/events(from:)-9gody":{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns an asynchronous sequence of the server-sent events (","type":"text"},{"code":"text/event-stream","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"found in ","type":"text"},{"code":"bytes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Use this function instead of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSON.values(from:format:options:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with format ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSON.StreamFormat.serverSentEvents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"if the event names or identifiers matter, or if the data of events is not JSON.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"events"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON0B0O6events4fromAA21ServerSentEventStreamVyxGx_tSciRzs5UInt8V7ElementRtzlFZ1SL_xmfp","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON21ServerSentEventStreamV","text":"ServerSentEventStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON0B0O6events4fromAA21ServerSentEventStreamVyxGx_tSciRzs5UInt8V7ElementRtzlFZ1SL_xmfp","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/events(from:)-9gody","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"events(from:)","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/json/events(from:)-9gody"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/fragments(from:at:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns an asynchronous sequence of the strings found at ","type":"text"},{"code":"pointer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the JSON values","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of ","type":"text"},{"code":"values","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Values without a string at this location are skipped. Streaming APIs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of large language models deliver their output in small JSON events; this function","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"extracts the text fragments from these events, e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"/choices/0/delta/content","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(OpenAI) or ","type":"text"},{"code":"/delta/partial_json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (Anthropic tool input), for example to feed them","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"into ","type":"text"},{"code":"partialValues(from:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"fragments"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON0B0O9fragments4from2atAA18JSONFragmentStreamVyxGx_AA11JSONPointerVtSciRzAC7ElementRtzlFZ1SL_xmfp","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"at"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON11JSONPointerV","text":"JSONPointer"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON18JSONFragmentStreamV","text":"JSONFragmentStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON0B0O9fragments4from2atAA18JSONFragmentStreamVyxGx_AA11JSONPointerVtSciRzAC7ElementRtzlFZ1SL_xmfp","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/fragments(from:at:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"fragments(from:at:)","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/json/fragments(from:at:)"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/partialValues(from:)-2rdtf":{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns an asynchronous sequence of snapshots of a single JSON value that arrives in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fragments of text, e.g. the arguments of a tool call streamed by a large language model.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each element is the best approximation of the value received so far; see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONPartialParser","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the rules. The last element is the complete value.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"partialValues"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON0B0O13partialValues4fromAA17PartialJSONStreamVyxGx_tSciRzSy7ElementRpzlFZ1SL_xmfp","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON17PartialJSONStreamV","text":"PartialJSONStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON0B0O13partialValues4fromAA17PartialJSONStreamVyxGx_tSciRzSy7ElementRpzlFZ1SL_xmfp","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/partialValues(from:)-2rdtf","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"partialValues(from:)","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/json/partialvalues(from:)-2rdtf"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/partialValues(from:)-6o2ml":{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns an asynchronous sequence of snapshots of a single JSON value that arrives in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"chunks of data; see ","type":"text"},{"code":"partialValues(from:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for fragments of text.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"partialValues"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON0B0O13partialValues4fromAA17PartialJSONStreamVyxGx_tSciRz10Foundation12DataProtocol7ElementRpzlFZ1SL_xmfp","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON17PartialJSONStreamV","text":"PartialJSONStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON0B0O13partialValues4fromAA17PartialJSONStreamVyxGx_tSciRz10Foundation12DataProtocol7ElementRpzlFZ1SL_xmfp","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/partialValues(from:)-6o2ml","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"partialValues(from:)","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/json/partialvalues(from:)-6o2ml"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/partialValues(from:)-dhl7":{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns an asynchronous sequence of snapshots of a single JSON value that arrives as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a sequence of UTF-8 encoded bytes; see ","type":"text"},{"code":"partialValues(from:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for fragments of text.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"partialValues"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON0B0O13partialValues4fromAA17PartialJSONStreamVyxGx_tSciRzs5UInt8V7ElementRtzlFZ1SL_xmfp","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON17PartialJSONStreamV","text":"PartialJSONStream"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11DynamicJSON0B0O13partialValues4fromAA17PartialJSONStreamVyxGx_tSciRzs5UInt8V7ElementRtzlFZ1SL_xmfp","text":"S"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSON/partialValues(from:)-dhl7","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"partialValues(from:)","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/json/partialvalues(from:)-dhl7"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONByteStream":{"abstract":[{"text":"An asynchronous sequence of chunks of data, which together form a stream of JSON values","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in one of the formats of ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSON.StreamFormat","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Use ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSON.stream(_:format:options:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to create","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONByteStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from an asynchronous sequence of JSON values. There is one chunk for each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value, followed by a chunk with the closing bytes of the stream, if there are any. The chunks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can be sent to a client as the body of a streaming HTTP response, or be written to a file.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The sequence throws a ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSON.StreamWriteError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if a value cannot be encoded; errors of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"base sequence are passed on.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONByteStream"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONByteStream","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONByteStream"}],"role":"symbol","title":"JSONByteStream","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/jsonbytestream"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONExtractionOptions":{"abstract":[{"text":"Options for extracting JSON values from text.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONExtractionOptions"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONExtractionOptions","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONExtractionOptions"}],"role":"symbol","title":"JSONExtractionOptions","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/jsonextractionoptions"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONFragmentStream":{"abstract":[{"text":"An asynchronous sequence of the strings found at a given location in a sequence of JSON","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"values. Use ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSON.fragments(from:at:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to create a ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONFragmentStream","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONFragmentStream"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONFragmentStream","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONFragmentStream"}],"role":"symbol","title":"JSONFragmentStream","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/jsonfragmentstream"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONPartialParser":{"abstract":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONPartialParser","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reads a single JSON value that arrives in fragments of arbitrary","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"size, and provides access to the best available approximation of the value at any time.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is useful for processing structured output and tool calls of large language models,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which are streamed as pieces of text that are not valid JSON by themselves.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONPartialParser"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONPartialParser","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONPartialParser"}],"role":"symbol","title":"JSONPartialParser","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/jsonpartialparser"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONPatch":{"abstract":[{"text":"Representation of a sequence of mutations applicable to JSON documents","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"based on RFC 6902. JSON Patch defines a JSON-based document structure","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for expressing a sequence of operations to apply to JSON data.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONPatch"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONPatch","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONPatch"}],"role":"symbol","title":"JSONPatch","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/jsonpatch"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONPointer":{"abstract":[{"code":"JSONPointer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" implements the ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONReference","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" protocol based on RFC 6901","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(JavaScript Object Notation (JSON) Pointer). A ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONPointer","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value is defined","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in terms of a sequence of reference tokens used to navigate through the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"structure of a JSON document.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONPointer"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONPointer","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONPointer"}],"role":"symbol","title":"JSONPointer","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/jsonpointer"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONResultSequence":{"abstract":[{"text":"A lazy sequence of results, one for each JSON value found in a sequence of bytes. Use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSON.results(from:format:options:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to create a ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONResultSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONResultSequence"}],"identifier":"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONResultSequence","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"JSONResultSequence"}],"role":"symbol","title":"JSONResultSequence","type":"topic","url":"/documentation/dynamicjson/jsonresultsequence"},"doc://DynamicJSON/documentation/DynamicJSON/JSONResultStream":{"abstract":[{"text":"An asynchronous sequ